			description: [
				"&d&o\"Not every creature of the Dream is wild. Some only wait for a friend.\""
				""
				"&7&eTamacraft&7 adds ten rare pets. Find one, tame it with a &eTamacraft Heart&7 and look after it - feed it, play with it, keep it clean and let it sleep - and it follows you, carries a backpack, helps you fight and has a special talent."
				"&7Craft a heart: five red dye around an amethyst shard."
				""
				"&d✦ Dream Star:&7 a Tamacraft Heart is one of its ingredients. Hearts are cheap: craft another one for the star later."
			]
			tasks: [
				{ id: "2B73D9D2891B9730", type: "item", item: "tamacraft:tamacraft_heart" }
			]
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "2B885DD2892D2086"
					type: "item"
					count: 8
					item: "tamacraft:pet_kibble"
