			x: 11.5d
			y: 2.0d
			dependencies: ["521A66951BF7C1C2"]
			description: [
				"&7Every pet has four needs from 0 to 100: &eHunger&7, &eFun&7, &eEnergy&7 and &eHygiene&7. Together they make its mood. Happy pets use their talent, sad ones do not, and miserable pets refuse to fight."
				"&7&ePet Kibble&7 (wheat with meat or fish) feeds every pet. A &eFood Bowl&7 filled with food feeds hungry pets by themselves. Pets eat modded food too."
			]
			tasks: [
